\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {V}{\ignorespaces Morphological benchmark Top-1 accuracy. The classical path is deterministic. Quantum figures are mean\,$\pm $\,std over $K{=}20$ independent PQC trainings (fresh 60-iteration SPSA per trial; range in brackets for NISQ). Noise is essentially neutral---the noiseless (ideal) and NISQ means coincide within one standard deviation---so the spread is driven by PQC training, not hardware noise. The quantum mean sits a modest $\sim $7 (IV) / $\sim $5 (OOV) points below the deterministic classical baseline, with the best trainings reaching parity or above.}}{5}{table.5}\protected@file@percent }
